      'Transitional Words and Connectors (أدوات الربط والانتقال المنطقي): 1- Addition (إضافة أفكار): Furthermore, Moreover, In addition to, Besides, What is more, Not only ... but also. 2- Contrast & Concession (التناقض والاستدراك): However, On the other hand, In contrast, Nonetheless, Nevertheless, Although, Even though, Despite / In spite of (+ noun/V-ing), While, Whereas. 3- Cause & Reason (السبب): Because, Since, As, Due to (+ noun/V-ing), Owing to, On account of, Thanks to. 4- Result & Consequence (النتيجة): Therefore, Consequently, As a result, Thus, Hence, For this reason. 5- Illustration & Examples (التمثيل): For example, For instance, Such as, To illustrate, Namely. 6- Summarizing & Concluding (الختام): In conclusion, To sum up, In summary, To conclude, All in all, On the whole, In short.'
