      'Reading Comprehension Strategies (كيفية حل قطعة الفهم وإحراز الدرجة النهائية): 1- Skimming (القراءة السريعة العامة): Read the title, the first and last paragraph, and the first sentence of each paragraph in 2 minutes to understand the general gist and main idea of the passage. 2- Scanning (البحث المركز): When reading the questions, highlight keywords (names, dates, places, numbers) and scan the text to locate the specific line holding the answer. 3- Guessing Unfamiliar Vocabulary in Context (تخمين الكلمات الصعبة): Do NOT panic if you see new words; identify the part of speech (noun, verb, adjective), look at the surrounding clues, prefixes/suffixes, and contrasting words (however, but) to infer the meaning. 4- Answering Tone and Attitude Questions: Look for emotive adjectives to determine if the author is optimistic, pessimistic, critical, neutral, biased, or humorous. 5- Finding the Best Title: The title must cover the ENTIRE passage, not just a single paragraph or detail.',
